---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftProjectRevision
---
Construct a ProjectRevision draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Introduce a creative but fair complication only after checking remaining time, resources, and prerequisites. Offer multiple recovery paths, revise logistics, and preserve the intended competencies rather than making the project impossible or changing its purpose.
